{
  "id": "kanazawa",
  "title": {
    "ja": "金沢おすすめマップ",
    "en": "Kanazawa Recommendations"
  },
  "summary": {
    "ja": "金沢のおすすめをまとめました。\n\n2日あれば、金沢市内はゆったりしつつも満足できるペースで楽しめると思います。時間に余裕があれば、金沢から日帰りで行ける素敵な場所もあります（「金沢から日帰り」のページで紹介しています）。\n\n金沢は「小京都」と呼ばれることもあり、たしかに京都と少し似た雰囲気があります。でも京都に比べると観光客が少なく、全体的にずっと快適。いかにも「観光地価格」なお店も少なく、海鮮が手頃で本当においしい。これが私が金沢を強くおすすめする一番の理由です。\n\nいちばん大切なのは、予定を詰め込みすぎないこと。本当に気になる場所だけを選んで、ゆっくり楽しんでください。肩の力を抜いて、素敵な旅を。",
    "en": "I've put together my recommendations for Kanazawa below.\n\nWith two days, I think you can enjoy Kanazawa City itself at a relaxed but satisfying pace. And if you have extra time, there are also some great places you can visit on a day trip from Kanazawa (see the \"Day trips from Kanazawa\" page).\n\nKanazawa is sometimes called a \"little Kyoto,\" and it's true that it has a somewhat similar atmosphere. But compared with Kyoto, there are fewer tourists, so it feels much more comfortable overall. There are also fewer places with obvious \"tourist pricing,\" and the seafood is affordable and genuinely delicious, which is one of the main reasons I highly recommend it.\n\nThe most important thing is not to overpack your schedule. Just take your time and enjoy the places that really interest you. Relax, and have an amazing trip."
  },
  "area": "金沢市内",
