      "no": 1,
      "name": {
        "ja": "ひがし茶屋街",
        "en": "Higashi Chaya District"
      },
      "heading": null,
      "lat": 36.572534,
      "lng": 136.66644,
      "color": "#C2453B",
      "time": {
        "ja": null,
        "en": null
      },
      "hours": {
        "ja": null,
        "en": null
      },
      "description": {
        "ja": "定番ですが、やっぱり行く価値ありです。\n金沢らしい茶屋街の風景をいちばん手軽に味わえる場所だと思います。メインの通りももちろん素敵ですが、私はそのすぐ裏にある細い路地が大好き。ぐっと静かになって、とても趣のある雰囲気です。",
        "en": "It's a classic choice, but it really is worth visiting.\nI think it's the easiest place to experience the traditional teahouse-district scenery that Kanazawa is known for. The main street is lovely, of course, but I also really like the narrow backstreets just behind it. They're much quieter and have a very charming atmosphere."
      },
      "subs": [
        {
          "name": {
            "ja": "志摩（しま）＋離れの茶室で抹茶",
            "en": "Shima (+ matcha in the separate tea room)"
          },
          "text": {
            "ja": "街並みを眺めて歩くだけでなく、実際にかつてのお茶屋の建物の中に入って、静かで洗練された空気を体験できます。\n特におすすめなのが離れの茶室。手頃な値段で抹茶と和菓子がいただけて、そのしつらえが本当に素晴らしい。観光の中心地にありながら落ち着いていて、「特別な体験をした」という気持ちになれます。",
            "en": "This is more than just a place to walk around and look at the streets. You can actually go inside a former teahouse building and experience its quiet, refined atmosphere.\nWhat I especially recommend is the separate tea room. You can enjoy matcha and Japanese sweets at a reasonable price, and the setting is wonderful. Even though it's right in the middle of a major sightseeing area, it still feels peaceful, and it really gives you that feeling of having had a special experience."
          },
          "url": "https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Shima+Kanazawa"
        },
        {
          "name": {
            "ja": "茶房&BARゴーシュ",
            "en": "Sabo & Bar Gosh"
          },
          "text": {
            "ja": "裏路地にひっそりあるので比較的空いていることが多く、休憩にぴったり。しばらく歩いて「ちょっと座りたいな」と思ったときに最適です。雰囲気もとても素敵です。",
            "en": "Because it's tucked away on a backstreet, it's often less crowded, so it's a great place to take a break. If you've been walking for a while and feel like sitting down for a rest, this is perfect. The atmosphere is also really nice."
          },
          "url": "https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Sabo+and+Bar+Gosh+Kanazawa"
        }
