      "description": {
        "ja": "ひがし茶屋街より小さく、より静かでこぢんまりとした雰囲気の茶屋街です。\n川沿いの景色が美しく、迷路のような細い路地を歩き回るだけで楽しい。ひがし茶屋街のすぐ近くなのに人はずっと少なく、落ち着いた空気をゆっくり味わえます。",
        "en": "This area is smaller than Higashi Chaya District and has a quieter, more intimate feel.\nThe riverside scenery is beautiful, and the narrow side streets feel almost like a maze, which makes it fun just to wander around. Even though it's very close to Higashi Chaya District, it feels much less crowded, which makes it a great place to enjoy a calm, relaxed atmosphere."
