      "description": {
        "ja": "金沢といえば海鮮。それをいちばんストレートに楽しめるのがここだと思います。\n特に朝の時間帯がおすすめ。とても有名な場所なので、「金沢らしいものを外したくない」なら安心の選択肢です。京都の錦市場と比べると、全体的に値段も少し良心的に感じます。",
        "en": "When people think of Kanazawa, they often think of seafood, and this is probably the most straightforward place to enjoy it.\nI especially recommend going in the morning. It's such a famous spot that it's kind of the \"safe choice\" if you want to make sure you don't miss something iconic. Compared with Nishiki Market in Kyoto, I think the prices here feel a bit more reasonable overall."
