      "description": {
        "ja": "ひがし茶屋街に比べて人がずっと少なく、自分のペースで歩きやすいエリアです。\n小さな茶屋街ですが素敵なカフェがいくつかあって、ちょっとした「穴場」感があるのも魅力。人混みが苦手な方には特におすすめです。",
        "en": "Compared with Higashi Chaya District, this area has far fewer people, so it's much easier to walk around at your own pace.\nIt's a small district, but there are several nice cafés, and it has a bit of a hidden-gem feel, which is part of its charm. If you don't like overly crowded places, I really recommend it."
      },
      "subs": [
