          },
          "text": {
            "ja": "奥にカフェスペースがあり、落ち着いた空間で和菓子をいただけます。ひと休みにぴったりの場所です。",
            "en": "There's a café space in the back where you can enjoy traditional Japanese sweets in a calm setting. It's a great place to stop and take a break."
