    {
      "no": 8,
      "name": {
        "ja": "妙立寺（みょうりゅうじ・忍者寺）",
        "en": "Myoryuji Temple (Ninja Temple)"
      },
      "heading": null,
      "lat": 36.555384,
      "lng": 136.648997,
      "color": "#2B7BB9",
      "time": {
        "ja": null,
        "en": null
      },
      "hours": {
        "ja": null,
        "en": null
      },
      "description": {
        "ja": "体験型で楽しめるお寺です。\n建物のあちこちに巧妙な仕掛けや隠し部屋がありますが、見せるために作られた観光施設という感じはなく、歴史ある建物そのものの面白さを実感できます。金沢らしいユニークな体験です。\n\n※電話での予約が必要です。自動音声やスタッフの対応は基本的に日本語なので、予約に助けが必要な場合は、ホテルのスタッフや金沢駅の観光案内所に相談するとサポートしてもらえます。",
        "en": "This is a fun, experience-based temple visit.\nThere are lots of clever architectural tricks and hidden features, but it doesn't feel like a tourist attraction created just for show. It really lets you appreciate the fascination of a historic building. It's a unique experience that feels very Kanazawa.\n\nNote: You need to make a reservation by phone. The automated system and staff usually operate in Japanese, so if you need help booking, a hotel staff member or the tourist information center at Kanazawa Station can assist you."
      },
      "links": [
