    {
      "no": 10,
      "name": {
        "ja": "魚がし食堂 金沢駅Rinto店",
        "en": "Uogashi Shokudo, Rinto branch (Kanazawa Station)"
      },
      "heading": {
        "ja": "絶対に外せないごはん：魚がし食堂（海鮮）",
        "en": "A meal you really should not miss: Uogashi Shokudo (seafood)"
      },
      "lat": 36.579824,
      "lng": 136.649148,
      "color": "#E08A1E",
      "time": {
        "ja": null,
        "en": null
      },
      "hours": {
        "ja": null,
        "en": null
      },
      "description": {
        "ja": "金沢に来たら、海鮮はぜひ食べてほしいもののひとつ。\nこのお店は手頃で量もたっぷり、満足度がとにかく高いです。金沢にいたら毎日でも行きたいくらい好きで、実際に同じ日の昼と夜の両方に行ったこともあります。おすすめは2店舗（もう1店は「中央市場店」）。\n\nRinto店は金沢駅にあるのでアクセスは抜群ですが、1時間ほど待つこともあります。日本の電話番号があれば、整理券を取るときに「お店を離れて待つ」を選ぶと、順番が近づいたときに自動で電話をくれます。駅のカフェや本屋さんで待てるので便利です。",
        "en": "If you come to Kanazawa, seafood is definitely something you should try.\nThis restaurant is affordable, the portions are generous, and the overall satisfaction level is really high. I like it so much that if I were in Kanazawa, I'd happily go every day. I've actually gone there for both lunch and dinner on the same day before. I recommend two branches (the other one is the Central Wholesale Market branch).\n\nThe Rinto branch at Kanazawa Station has unbeatable access, but the wait can sometimes be around an hour. If you have a Japanese phone number, when you get your queue ticket you can choose the option to wait away from the restaurant, and they'll automatically call you when your turn is getting close. That makes it easy to wait in a station café or bookstore instead."
      },
      "links": [
        {
          "label": "GoogleMaps",
          "url": "https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Uogashi+Shokudo+Rinto+Kanazawa+Station"
