        "ja": "駅から少し離れていてバスに乗る必要がありますが、個人的にはこちらのほうがさらにおすすめ。何度か行っていますが、一度も待ったことがありません。Rinto店より少し安く感じて、量も少し多め、メニューも少し違います。",
        "en": "This one is a little farther from the station and requires taking a bus, but personally I recommend it even more. I've been several times and never had to wait. It also feels slightly cheaper than the Rinto branch, the portions seem a little larger, and the menu is slightly different."
